    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2024_0649","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Agnès Haddad talks about the politics of the colour orange. There is a long passage about a single brush, which the artist calls "the elder".</Description>
